{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EpeLscDkj7GzHCS8mzQs7Y","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 contamcal-irt-calibration 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (81 个)\\n\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_r3**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42_v2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_100pct_05B**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_3B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_injection**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_005_noise_prop**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_confounding**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp002-signal-d025-05B | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp_001_eval_15B_d025_aligned | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k | GSM8K (1319 items, ~5300 params) NUTS feasibility validation. If warmup produces samples within 2h → NUTS viable for small benchmarks. Else → ADVI fallback. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_3B_v2（排队等待 GPU）\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v2: Tiered IRT calibration (D023): GSM8K/ARC direct NUTS + MMLU subsampled 1000 items + ADVI robustness check. Fixes v1 issues: aligned-only, signal-derived exposure, --max-items.（准备中）\\n- exp_008_instruct_rl_proxy: RL proxy experiment (D021 Problem 3): Use Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct (SFT+RL post-trained) as RL regime data point. 3-regime comparison: base (pretrained) → d000 (SFT) → Instruct (SFT+RL). Compute all 4 signals on Instruct model, observe signal value changes across training regimes. No additional training needed.\\\"（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v2（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42_v3: 3B s42 baseline eval v3 (v2 被 SIGKILL). 等 GPU 空出后用绝对路径重新提交。（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v6: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v6, GPU 2 干净状态直接提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v6: 100% dosage 0.5B s42 contaminated eval (v6, GPU 2 干净状态直接提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v4: 100% dosage 0.5B s42 contaminated eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v4: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v2（准备中）\\n- …另有 4 项\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d005_aligned_v2** (success): 1.5B d005 aligned eval — low-dose contamination response at 1.5B scale\\n- **exp_001_sft_d100_3B** (success): 100% dosage contaminated SFT on Qwen2.5-3B (seed=42): maximum contamination at largest controlled scale\\n- **exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v4** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 40 / 负向 0 / 失败 16 / 共 58\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_100pct_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_15B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_004_sim_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_005_noise_prop: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_005_noise_prop_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_006_irt_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v1: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0192sDYmwiwCHXrgwVAp2XJh","session_id":"07207688-e133-4b52-9bbc-755cbd4866df","uuid":"88f8c1be-37f6-4e46-aea4-fe746fea7d60","timestamp":"2026-05-14T1